# LF everywhere, enforced in the repository regardless of contributor platform.
#
# The mod shipped as CRLF through upstream 2.2 (Mura worked on Windows) and was normalised to LF
# in this fork. LF is what Qud mods overwhelmingly use — a sample of installed Workshop mods found
# no CRLF at all — and .NET's XML parser is indifferent either way.
#
# To read a clean diff against the pre-normalisation baseline, use:
#     git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol upstream-2.2
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched, never diffed as text.
